1
00:00:00,285 --> 00:00:01,515
PENNY:
You know what, hang on.

2
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:03,190
(Penny:)What if Sheldon had no choice

3
00:00:03,188 --> 00:00:04,688
(Penny:)but to be respectful?

4
00:00:04,689 --> 00:00:08,889
(Leonard:)Is there a switch on the back
of his neck we don't know about?

5
00:00:08,894 --> 00:00:10,964
PENNY:
No.

6
00:00:10,962 --> 00:00:12,762
(Penny:)What I'm saying is you could add
a clause to the contract

7
00:00:12,764 --> 00:00:14,394
(Penny:)that he can't make fun
of Howard.

8
00:00:14,399 --> 00:00:16,129
(Bernadette:)How would you enforce it?

9
00:00:16,134 --> 00:00:17,964
(Sheldon:)Oh, please.
Any contract I sign

10
00:00:17,969 --> 00:00:20,669
(Sheldon:)is enforced by my own
personal code of ethics.

11
00:00:20,672 --> 00:00:22,502
(Amy:)And his obsessive-compulsive
disorder.

12
00:00:22,507 --> 00:00:23,877
(Sheldon:)Yeah, that, too.

13
00:00:24,743 --> 00:00:25,843
(Sheldon:)And scoot over.

14
00:00:25,844 --> 00:00:28,374
(Sheldon:)Part of your shadow's
on my spot.

15
00:00:31,583 --> 00:00:33,183
(Leonard:)Howard, what do you think?

16
00:00:33,185 --> 00:00:35,355
(Howard:)I'm on board.

17
00:00:35,353 --> 00:00:36,883
(Sheldon:)I'll add it right now.

18
00:00:36,888 --> 00:00:39,388
Oh, baby, it's addendum time!

19
00:00:43,094 --> 00:00:45,024
(line ringing)

20
00:00:45,030 --> 00:00:46,530
EMILY:
Hello?

21
00:00:46,531 --> 00:00:48,001
(Raj:)Hey, Emily, listen,

22
00:00:47,999 --> 00:00:50,169
(Raj:)I've been thinking,
and I'm not sure

23
00:00:50,168 --> 00:00:52,068
(Raj:)it's a good idea
that I come over.

24
00:00:52,070 --> 00:00:53,470
(Howard:)Oh.

25
00:00:53,471 --> 00:00:56,271
(crying):
Okay. I understand.

26
00:00:56,274 --> 00:00:58,374
(Raj:)No, no. Please don't cry.

